      "heading": "Connectivity",
      "source_text": "- Network: 2.5G (GSM/ GPRS/ EDGE): 850 / 900 / 1800 / 1900 MHz | 3G (HSPA+ 42Mbps): 850 / 900 / 1900 / 2100 MHz | 4G (LTE Cat 3 100/50Mbps) : up to 6 different band sets(Dependent on market)\n- Connectivity: WiFi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac (HT80) | GPS / GLONASS | NFC, Bluetooth® 4.0 (LE) | IR LED (Remote Control), MHL 2.0",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsungmobilepress.com/media-assets/galaxy-s4?tab=specs",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/galaxy-s/galaxy-s4-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Display",
      "source_text": "- Display: 5 inch Full HD Super AMOLED (1920 x 1080) display, 441 ppi",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsungmobilepress.com/media-assets/galaxy-s4?tab=specs",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/galaxy-s/galaxy-s4-source.md"
