      "source_file": "sources/samsung/galaxy-s/galaxy-s4-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Camera",
      "source_text": "- Camera: Main(Rear): 13 Mega pixel Auto Focus camera with Flash & Zero Shutter Lag, BIS | Sub (Front): 2 Mega pixel camera, Full HD recording @30fps with Zero Shutter Lag, BIS",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsungmobilepress.com/media-assets/galaxy-s4?tab=specs",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/galaxy-s/galaxy-s4-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Other technical specifications",
      "source_text": "- Video: Codec: MPEG4, H.264, H.263, DivX, DivX3.11, VC-1, VP8, WMV7/8, Sorenson Spark, HEVC | Recording & Playback: Full HD (1080p)\n- Audio: Codec: MP3, AMR-NB/WB, AAC/AAC+/eAAC+, WMA, OGG, FLAC, AC-3, apt-X\n- Sensor: Accelerometer, RGB light, Geomagnetic, Proximity, Gyro, Barometer | Temperature & Humidity, Gesture",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsungmobilepress.com/media-assets/galaxy-s4?tab=specs",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/galaxy-s/galaxy-s4-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Storage and memory",
      "source_text": "- Memory: 16/ 32/ 64 GB User memory + microSD slot (up to 64GB) | 2GB RAM",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsungmobilepress.com/media-assets/galaxy-s4?tab=specs",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/galaxy-s/galaxy-s4-source.md"
